## Acceptance criteria

- [x] Documentation is about the planned Unity game, not a detailed prototype README.
- [x] Prototype coverage is brief and points to the separate historical folder.
- [x] Planned files, folders, assets, architecture, milestones, quality, and risks are documented.
- [x] Every file inside `TODO/` ends in `.todo`.
- [x] TODO files include status, tasks, acceptance criteria, evidence, and completion log.
- [x] README links the planning package.
- [x] Context is synchronized in this repository.

